@inherits LayoutComponentBase
@using Slip39Demo.Core

@* One application, two pages, no sidebar. The template's nav rendered a single
   link to the page the reader was already on, and nothing referenced it. *@
<main class="app">
    @Body

    @* The version, on every page rather than one of them.

       It is here because the same number is stamped into every share README and into
       the verification record inside each backup. Somebody comparing a backup against
       the tool that made it needs to be able to read the tool's version without opening
       a build log, and a footer in the layout is the only place that is true on all
       pages. AppVersion is the single source; see Directory.Build.props. *@
    <footer class="app-footer">
        slip39-backup v@AppVersion.Current
    </footer>
</main>
